  "name": "fontconfig-rs",
  "description": "A Rust wrapper providing high-level and low-level bindings to the FreeDesktop fontconfig library for system-wide font discovery and matching. It facilitates querying font properties, resolving font patterns, and retrieving filesystem paths for specific font families and styles via a safe RAII-based interface.",
